<Base title="About this directory" description="How this free Columbus property management directory collects and verifies data.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>This is a free, independent directory of property management companies in the Columbus, Ohio area. It has no paid listings, no featured placement and no lead routing.</p>
  <h2>Where the data comes from</h2>
  <p>Facts (fees, services, service areas, license status) come from publicly available sources. Each fact shows its source and the dates it was captured and last verified. Unknown values are left blank rather than guessed.</p>
